%header.view-header
  .wrapper{role: 'layout'}
    %h1 CouncilTracker

%main.view-content{role: 'layout'}
  .wrapper{role: 'layout'}
    %p CouncilTracker.ie tracks and publishes roll-call votes at monthly council meetings, so you can see how your councillors voted on issues you care about.
    
    %p Keep in mind that the majority of council votes – at committee, and at the monthly meetings – are taken by voice, and so we're not able to track how each councillor voted and record that here.
    
    %p Select a council to view votes and motions:
    %ul.list.-enumerable
      - @councils.each do |council|
        %li
          = link_to council.name, "/#{council.slug}"
